<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz November unemployment unchanged at 4.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz November unemployment unchanged at 4.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people registered as unemployed in Kyrgyzstan in November totalled 4.5 percent of the workforce -- almost unchanged from the previous month, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p> KYRGYZ UNEMPLOYMENT	 Nov 96    Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p> number unemployed	   78,100    78,300    46,000</p>
<p> percentage of workforce    4.5	 4.5	 2.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are for those officially registered as unemployed in the former Soviet republic of 4.5 million.</p>
</text>
